<title>BRAZIL: Telemig Jan-April net 112.2 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telemig Jan-April net 112.2 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal telecommunications firm Telemig, a unit of the federal Telebras system, released the following preliminary financial results for the January-April period.</p>
<p>		   Jan-April 1997     Jan-April 1996</p>
<p>Net		   112.2 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Gross Revs	  560.8 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Net Oper Revs     432.6 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Oper Profit	 169.8 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Profit    169.1 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Note: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement its net worth totalled 1.881 billion reais in the January-April period.</p>
<p>It also said installed fixed lines reached 1.59 million while cellular terminals totalled 268,833 in the period.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
